{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeSource.vue",
    "title": "原始材料读取与证据导航",
    "summary": "按材料键及可选 digest 请求材料，展示当前或历史版本、引用位置与附件，并把关联知识和内部链接接回统一导航。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "loading",
        "title": "可选版本定位与竞态保护",
        "body": "组件接收材料键、可选 digest 和引用行范围；请求由材料键或 digest 变化触发。提供 digest 时会将其作为查询参数请求指定内容，未提供时仅按材料键请求，版本固定性取决于后端解析，前端材料本身不能证明其不可变。`generation` 只允许最新请求更新材料、错误和标题。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "rendering",
        "title": "材料状态与内容呈现",
        "body": "界面区分加载、不可用和成功状态，并按返回的 current 标记显示“当前版本”或“历史版本”。若有行号则显示引用位置；代码或非 Markdown 文件进入代码查看器，Markdown 可同时呈现引用原文块与全文，图片附件随后展示。存在知识解读时还可创建知识帧继续阅读。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "navigation",
        "title": "关联知识与内部链接",
        "body": "代码引用会先查询同键文章，成功时以文章标题创建知识帧，失败则降级为原始材料帧。Markdown 内部链接以当前材料目录为基准规整 `..`、`.` 和普通路径，去掉片段后补成 `omem:` 键，再复用同一引用流程；因此当前实现定位关联文件，但不保留目标锚点。[[c3]][[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "材料请求与代次保护",
        "reason": "支持 digest 为可选查询参数、监听触发条件，以及最新请求独占状态更新。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeSource.vue",
          "startLine": 5,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "const props = defineProps<{ prefix: string; materialKey: string; digest?: string; startLine?: number; endLine?: number }>();\nconst emit = defineEmits<{ navigate: [frame: KnowledgeFrame]; loaded: [title: string] }>();\ntype Material = { key: string; title: string; text: string; path: string | null; codeLanguage?: string "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "原始材料阅读界面",
        "reason": "支持版本标记、引用行、代码与 Markdown 分派、知识入口及图片呈现。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeSource.vue",
          "startLine": 26,
          "endLine": 40
        },
        "quote": "<template>\n  <section class=\"knowledge-source\">\n    <OmEmpty v-if=\"error\" title=\"原始材料不可用\" :description=\"error\" />\n    <p v-else-if=\"!material\">正在读取固定原文…</p>\n    <template v-else>\n      <h2>{{ material.title }}</h2>\n      <div class=\"source-actions\"><OmBadge>原始材料 · {{ material.current ? '当前版本' : '历史版本' }}</OmBadge><OmBu"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "关联文章的降级导航",
        "reason": "支持先查询文章元数据，失败时仍打开原始材料帧。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeSource.vue",
          "startLine": 15,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "async function reference(key: string) {\n  try { const a = await knowledgeApi<ArticleMeta>(props.prefix, \"/articles/\" + encodeURIComponent(key)); emit(\"navigate\", knowledgeFrame(key, a.title)); }\n  catch { emit(\"navigate\", { kind: \"source\", id: JSON.stringify({ key }), title: \"关联原始材料\" }); }\n}"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "Markdown 内部路径解析",
        "reason": "支持以当前文件目录规整内部路径、去除片段并转换为材料键。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeSource.vue",
          "startLine": 19,
          "endLine": 23
        },
        "quote": "function internal(path: string) {\n  if (!material.value?.path) return;\n  const base = material.value.path.split(\"/\").slice(0, -1);\n  for (const p of path.split(\"#\")[0]!.split(\"/\")) { if (p === \"..\") base.pop(); else if (p && p !== \".\") base.push(p); }\n  void reference(\"omem:\" + base.join(\"/\"));"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "未提供 digest 时，材料端点选择当前版本、最新版本还是其他版本？",
        "why": "前端只按 materialKey 发出请求，虽展示后端返回的 current 状态，但现有材料没有给出服务端版本解析规则。",
        "nextStep": "核对材料 API 路由和版本查询测试，明确无 digest 请求的稳定性及缓存语义。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c2"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
